{
 "_": [
  "Game of Thrones LE on the SPIKE 1 rig (PAD-943): VPW's 'Game of Thrones LE (Stern 2015) VPW' 1.2.1 (VPUniverse file 12510).",
  "platform: spike1 puts PAD.Controller on tools/spike1_emu's run (s1bridge.py): switches are 1000 + node*64 + index",
  "(the rig's s1switches.json numbering), lamps 1000 + node*100 + index, coils 1000 + node*64 + index.",
  "The switches are matched by the table's own numbering (Stern's manual) and the scripts' meaning to the rig's names;",
  "the lamps are the LE's LED table read out of the game program (the table names its lights li<LED number>);",
  "the coils are the program's own. GUESS marks what a game on the real table should confirm.",
  "The elevator (KickerFloor -> KickerUPF/KickerTopFloor) and the dragon scoop (Kicker37) keep the table's own",
  "script: the rig's walk found no ELEVATOR POPPER switch and the dragon's coil is not named, so the real game",
  "does not see the elevator shot yet."
 ],
